  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maintaining the integrity of globally significant intact tropical forest landscapes in the Gulf Province and Western Province of Papua New Guinea (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outputs from this GEF PPG are as follows.
I.	Full project document in FAO-GEF template along with annexes that fully address comments from the GEFSEC, STAP, and GEF Council members 
II.	Co-finance Commitment letters
III.	ADG PS approval of the OPIM submission as per Manual Section 701</narrative>
  </description>
